    "When the call had ended, and Daddy had lain flat on the carpet for a while saying “oh dear” at the ceiling, Samuel found the television remote and pressed every button on it at once, which is the way knights operate technology. The screen leapt into life with a blare of trumpets — **BA-DUM-BUM!** — and a newsreader with extremely tidy hair.",
