    "She did not look up. “Football,” she said. “Colander. And a worried daddy.”",
    "Daddy’s mouth fell open. “How did you…?”",
    "“Grass stain on the big boy’s sock. Little rows of round dents in the small one’s hair. And you keep looking at your watch like it owes you money.” Now she looked up, and her eyes were as bright and sharp as two needles. “What do you want?”",
