    "Daddy, who had been edging out of the picture, edged back in. Ever since Mummy had found the boys on that very first video call, he had been living in quiet terror of what she might think of his parenting, which so far had involved a missing bridge, a mysterious bolt and no vegetables whatsoever. He had gone rather pink.",
